  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gas Opportunities Reverse Trade Mission (RTM), through Meridian International Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Haiti Gas Opportunities Reverse Trade Mission will familiarize up to eight (8) Haitian energy sector representatives with U.S. gas and gas-related infrastructure solutions. The RTM itinerary will include meetings and site visits with U.S. gas and gas-related infrastructure suppliers, as well as federal, state, and local energy officials, regulators, and utilities.</narrative>
  </description>
